# Author aliases — copy to author-aliases.conf and edit.
# Merge duplicate git author names and GitHub usernames into one canonical name.
#
# Format (tab-separated):
#   Canonical Name	alias1	alias2
#
# First column = name used in reports. Other columns = git author names or
# GitHub usernames that should be merged (case-insensitive).
# Add new aliases when you spot duplicates in report output.

Jane Smith	jsmith-gh	jane.smith@company.com
John Doe	johndoe-work	JohnDoe
